---A `QuestType` config contains data about one of the many quests in the game.
---
---These config types can be found within the `config.Quest` table:
---
---Info: A `QuestType` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot,
---however, be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Information available within an `QuestType` includes:
---@class QuestTypeConfig
---@field id integer (Read-only) The ID of this config type.
---@field configName string (Read-only) The name of this config, i.e. `"QUEST_200"`.
---@field typeName string (Read-only) The type of this config. Will always be `"Quest"`.
---@field deprecated boolean (Read-only) Whether this quest config has been deprecated. It has often been superseded by a different valid config. Deprecated quests are occasionally referenced in order to use their `iconID`.
---@field name string (Read-only) The display name of this config type.
---@field sortName string (Read-only) The string to use when sorting quest names alphabetically. For example, "Lost Tribe, The."
---@field isMembers boolean (Read-only) Whether this quest is for members.
---@field questPoints integer (Read-only) How many quest points are rewarded for completing this quest.
---@field type QuestType (Read-only) The type of quest.
---@field difficulty QuestDifficulty (Read-only) The difficulty rating of this quest.
---@field iconID integer (Read-only) The sprite ID to display for this quest. This is shown on any MiniMenuEntry related to this quest.
---@field startCoordGrids CoordGrid[] (Read-only) A list of CoordGrids used to indicate where this quest can be started.
---@field viaCoordGrid CoordGrid (Read-only) An optional CoordGrid to help navigate to one of the quest starting coordinates.
---@field preReqQuestPoints integer (Read-only) How many quest points the Player Character must have before starting this quest.
---@field preReqQuests QuestTypeConfig[] (Read-only) A list of quests the Player Character must have completed in order to start this quest.
---@field preReqSkills QuestPreReqSkill[] (Read-only) A list of SkillType level requirement checks. Player Characters must meet all of the given requirements to start this quest.
---@field completedPreReqQuestPoints boolean (Read-only) Whether the Player Character has the required number of quest points to start this quest.
---@field completedPreReqQuests boolean[] (Read-only) Returns a list of boolean values for each prerequisite quest, indicating whether the Player Character has completed each of them.
---@field completedPreReqSkills boolean[] (Read-only) Returns a list of boolean values for each prerequisite skill level check, indicating whether the Player Character has completed each of them.
---@field canStartQuest boolean (Read-only) Whether the Player Character is able to start this quest. This returns `true` if all prerequisite checks are completed.
---@field hasStartedQuest boolean (Read-only) Whether the Player Character has started this quest.
---@field hasFinishedQuest boolean (Read-only) Whether the Player Character has completed this quest.
---@field masterQuestVars MasterQuestVarPlayer[] (Read-only) An array holding a list of MasterQuestVarPlayer descriptors. There will always be one element in this array.
---@field params ParamType[] (Read-only) Returns a list of all the ParamTypes stored in this config.
local QuestTypeConfig = {}

---Returns the corresponding output value for the given input ParamType.
---@param param ParamType The input param value.
---@return any # The corresponding output value. Returns `param.defaultValue` if the param is not found in the data structure.
function QuestTypeConfig:GetParamValue(param) end

---Returns whether this config contains output data for the given input ParamType.
---@param param ParamType The input param value.
---@return boolean # Whether a corresponding value exists in this config for ParamType.
function QuestTypeConfig:HasParam(param) end

---A container table holding data about a quest's progress tracking variable. A quest will have only one of these.
---
---Info: All properties are read-only.
---@class MasterQuestVarPlayer
---@field varPlayer VarType (Read-only) The `var.VarPlayer` which holds the current progress value.
---@field startState integer (Read-only) The starting variable value for this quest. Values below this indicates that the quest has not been started.
---@field endState integer (Read-only) The completion value for this quest. Actual variable value may be greater than this, indicating post-completion progress.
local MasterQuestVarPlayer = {}

---A container table holding data about a skill prerequisite.
---
---Info: All properties are read-only.
---@class QuestPreReqSkill
---@field skillType SkillType (Read-only) The skill type to check.
---@field minimumLevel integer (Read-only) The minimum skill level required by the Player Character to complete this prerequisite.
local QuestPreReqSkill = {}

